  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 204.07 Standard of Proof. Unless otherwise specified by law, the standard of proof shall be by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. #6651, eff 12-10-97; ss by #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-A, eff 11-29-07",
